// ValidEmails.php
namespace App\Rules;

use Illuminate\Contracts\Validation\Rule;

class ValidEmails implements Rule
{
    public function passes($attribute, $value)
    {
        if ($attribute === 'to' || $attribute === 'from') {
            return filter_var($value, FILTER_VALIDATE_EMAIL) !== false;
        }
        return false;
    }

    public function message()
    {
        return 'The :attribute must be a valid email address.';
    }
}
```

Usage in a Laravel controller:
```php
use App\Rules\ValidEmails;

public function store(Request $request)
{
    $validatedData = $request->validate([
        'to' => ['required', new ValidEmails],
        'from' => ['required', new ValidEmails],
    ]);

    // Process the validated data
}
```

In this solution, the "ValidEmails" class implements the necessary logic to validate the "to" and "from" fields as valid email addresses. The "passes" method checks if the attribute is "to" or "from" and then uses the filter_var function with FILTER_VALIDATE_EMAIL to validate the email format. The "message" method provides the error message if the validation fails. Finally, in the Laravel controller, the custom rule "ValidEmails" is used to validate the "to" and "from" fields in the request data.

```csharp
using System;
using System.Collections.Generic;

// Define an interface for pipeline contributors
public interface IPipelineContributor
{
    void Execute();
}

// Define a class to represent the pipeline
public class Pipeline
{
    private readonly List<IPipelineContributor> contributors = new List<IPipelineContributor>();

    // Method to register a contributor's operation
    public void RegisterContributor(IPipelineContributor contributor)
    {
        contributors.Add(contributor);
    }

    // Method to execute the operations in the pipeline in the specified order
    public void ExecutePipeline()
    {
        foreach (var contributor in contributors)
        {
            contributor.Execute();
        }
    }
}

// Define a class to represent the ContributorExecutingAfter<T>
public class ContributorExecutingAfter<T> : IPipelineContributor where T : IPipelineContributor
{
    public void Execute()
    {
        // Implement the logic to execute the operation after the specified contributor
        Console.WriteLine($"Executing operation after {typeof(T).Name}");
    }
}

// Example usage
public class ExampleContributor : IPipelineContributor
{
    public void Execute()
    {
        Console.WriteLine("Executing example operation");
    }
}

public class Program
{
    public static void Main()
    {
        // Create a pipeline
        var pipeline = new Pipeline();

        // Register contributors with the pipeline
        pipeline.RegisterContributor(new ContributorExecutingAfter<ExampleContributor>());
        pipeline.RegisterContributor(new ExampleContributor());

        // Execute the pipeline
        pipeline.ExecutePipeline();
    }
}
```

In this solution, a `Pipeline` class is defined to manage the contributors and execute their operations in the specified order. Contributors implement the `IPipelineContributor` interface and specify the order of their operations using the `ContributorExecutingAfter<T>` class. The `Main` method demonstrates the registration of contributors and the execution of the pipeline. When executed, the operations are executed in the order specified by the contributors.

물론, 다음은 Dart AST를 사용하여 Flutter 카운터 앱을 JSON 트리로 변환하는 방법의 예입니다:
```dart
import 'dart:convert';
import 'dart:io';

import 'package:analyzer/dart/analysis/utilities.dart';
import 'package:analyzer/dart/ast/ast.dart';
'package:analyzer/dart/ast/visitor.dart' 임포트;

void main() async {
 final path = 'path/to/your/flutter/file.dart';
 final content = await File(path).readAsString();
 최종 parseResult = parseString(content: content, throwIfDiagnostics: false);
 최종 rootNode = parseResult.unit;

 최종 방문자 = _FlutterToJsonVisitor();
 rootNode.accept(visitor);

 최종 jsonString = json.encode(visitor.jsonMap);
 print(jsonString);
}

class _FlutterToJsonVisitor extends RecursiveAstVisitor<void> {
 final jsonMap = <String, dynamic>{};

 @override
 void visitClassDeclaration(ClassDeclaration node) {
 if (node.name.name == 'CounterApp') {
 final appMap = jsonMap[node.name.name] = <String, dynamic>{};
 node.visitChildren(_FlutterAppVisitor(appMap));
 }

 super.visitClassDeclaration(node);
 }
}

FlutterAppVisitor 클래스 _FlutterAppVisitor extends RecursiveAstVisitor<void> {
 최종 Map<String, 동적> appMap;

 _FlutterAppVisitor(this.appMap);

 @override
 void visitMethodInvocation(MethodInvocation node) {
 if (node.target?.toString() == 'MaterialApp' &&
 node.methodName.name == 'title') {
 appMap['title'] = node.argumentList.arguments[0].toString();
 }

 super.visitMethodInvocation(node);
 }

 @override
 void visitMethodDeclaration(MethodDeclaration node) {
 if (node.name.name == 'build') {
 final buildMap = appMap['build'] = <String, dynamic>{};
 node.visitChildren(_FlutterBuildVisitor(buildMap));
 }

 super.visitMethodDeclaration(node);
 }
}

FlutterBuildVisitor 클래스 _FlutterBuildVisitor extends RecursiveAstVisitor<void> {
 final Map<String, 동적> buildMap;

 _FlutterBuildVisitor(this.buildMap);

 @override
 void visitVariableDeclarationList(VariableDeclarationList node) {
 if (node.parent?.toString() == 'Center(child: Column(') {
 for (node.variables의 마지막 변수) {
 if (variable.name.name == '_counter') {
 buildMap['counter'] = int.tryParse(variable.initializer.toString());
 }
 }
 }

 super.visitVariableDeclarationList(node);
 }
}
```
이 코드는 Flutter 앱의 Dart 코드의 AST 노드를 방문하여 앱의 프로퍼티에 대한 JSON 트리 표현을 생성하는 방문자 클래스 `_FlutterToJsonVisitor`를 정의합니다. 방문자는 먼저 `CounterApp` 클래스 선언을 검색하고 앱의 프로퍼티를 저장하기 위해 `jsonMap` 변수를 생성합니다. 그런 다음 `_FlutterAppVisitor` 방문자를 사용하여 `MaterialApp` 위젯의 `title` 속성을 검색하고 이를 `jsonMap` 변수에 저장합니다. 마지막으로, `_FlutterBuildVisitor` 방문자를 사용하여 `_counter` 변수 선언을 검색하고 그 값을 `jsonMap` 변수에 저장합니다.

이 코드를 사용하려면 `path/to/your/flutter/file.dart` 자리 표시자를 Flutter 앱의 Dart 코드에 대한 실제 경로로 바꾸기만 하면 됩니다. 이 코드를 실행하면 앱 프로퍼티의 JSON 트리 표현이 콘솔에 출력됩니다.

