    An integer will be provided in decimal format, and the challenge is to transmute this figure into a binary representation. The function should deliver a string, where each character signifies a binary digit. The characters within this representation will only be '0' or '1'.

    To enhance its recognizability, append the entry and conclusion of the string with a pair of extra characters, specifically 'db'. 

